Drop the founder portrait here as `founder-suraj.jpg`.

Recommended:
- 1200 x 1500 (4:5 portrait), sRGB, JPEG quality 78–82
- Editorial, quiet — soft indirect light, natural pose
- Neutral background (linen, natural wood, wall) — nothing branded
- Face fills roughly the upper third; shoulders visible

If this file is not present, components/FounderLetter.tsx falls
back to a single-column, letter-only layout with no broken image.
